WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:01.120
Five women.

2
00:00:01.120 --> 00:00:03.990
Five ways of standing up.

3
00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:06.450
Matangini Hazra.

4
00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:08.930
In September nineteen forty two,

5
00:00:08.930 --> 00:00:11.250
at over seventy, she led a march

6
00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:13.030
to the Tamluk police station,

7
00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:14.350
flag held high.

8
00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:16.250
She was shot dead there.

9
00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:18.350
People called her Gandhi buri,

10
00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:19.940
old lady Gandhi.

11
00:00:20.521 --> 00:00:21.701
Kanaklata Barua.

12
00:00:21.701 --> 00:00:24.341
That same month, in Gohpur,

13
00:00:24.341 --> 00:00:26.621
Assam, the seventeen year old

14
00:00:26.621 --> 00:00:28.161
led a procession to hoist the

15
00:00:28.161 --> 00:00:29.861
flag at the police station.

16
00:00:29.861 --> 00:00:31.551
She too was shot.

17
00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:33.420
Aruna Asaf Ali.

18
00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:35.893
On the ninth of August, nineteen

19
00:00:35.893 --> 00:00:37.860
forty two, with the leaders

20
00:00:37.860 --> 00:00:39.620
arrested, she hoisted the

21
00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:41.300
Congress flag in Bombay.

22
00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:43.210
Then she went underground.

23
00:00:43.836 --> 00:00:45.276
Sarojini Naidu.

24
00:00:45.276 --> 00:00:47.536
A poet, called the Nightingale

25
00:00:47.536 --> 00:00:48.336
of India.

26
00:00:48.336 --> 00:00:50.416
In nineteen twenty five, the

27
00:00:50.416 --> 00:00:52.136
first Indian woman to preside

28
00:00:52.136 --> 00:00:53.476
over the Congress.

29
00:00:53.476 --> 00:00:55.616
In nineteen forty seven, India's

30
00:00:55.616 --> 00:00:57.026
first woman governor.

31
00:00:57.628 --> 00:00:58.408
Usha Mehta.

32
00:00:58.408 --> 00:01:00.868
At twenty two, she ran the

33
00:01:00.868 --> 00:01:03.168
secret Congress Radio, until the

34
00:01:03.168 --> 00:01:04.578
police found it.

35
00:01:06.628 --> 00:01:07.888
For GS1 and Prelims:

36
00:01:07.888 --> 00:01:10.028
women led the freedom struggle,

37
00:01:10.028 --> 00:01:12.688
at the top of the Congress, and

38
00:01:12.688 --> 00:01:15.128
in Quit India, openly and

39
00:01:15.128 --> 00:01:17.508
underground: in Tamluk, Gohpur

40
00:01:17.508 --> 00:01:18.978
and Bombay.

41
00:01:19.993 --> 00:01:21.233
Five names.

42
00:01:21.233 --> 00:01:22.923
Carry them with you.
